      * Golden-master driver: CALL CSUTLDTC exactly like CORPT00C/COTRN02C.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DRVDTC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DATE      PIC X(10).
       01 WS-FMT       PIC X(10).
       01 WS-RESULT    PIC X(80).
       01 WS-RC        PIC S9(9) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-DATE FROM ENVIRONMENT 'T_DATE'
           ACCEPT WS-FMT  FROM ENVIRONMENT 'T_FMT'
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-RESULT
           CALL 'CSUTLDTC' USING WS-DATE WS-FMT WS-RESULT
           MOVE RETURN-CODE TO WS-RC
           DISPLAY WS-RESULT WITH NO ADVANCING
           DISPLAY WS-RC WITH NO ADVANCING
           MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
           STOP RUN.
